{"synopsis":"Nagi Kujo, Seorang Dokter birilian yang merawat pasien di zona konflik tanpa kenal lelah, pulang ke kampung halamannya, Jepang, untuk mengobati ayah angkatnya, seorang dermawan yang dulu menyelamatkan dirinya. Namun, pada saat kedatangannya, dia menemukan bahwa ayahnya dibunuh oleh sosok yang tidak dikenal. Dengan tekadnya untuk menyingkap kebenaran, Nagi mulai menyelidiki misteri yang menyelimuti kematian ayahnya.","alternative_title":"Black Surge","author":"TSUDA Houkou","artist":"MARUYAMA Takayuki","chapters":[{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"3c483e2f-e358-4df8-be16-0be99e6ad849","title":"Chapter 39","date":"2025-11-11"},{"number":"38","chapter":"38","slug":"088253b6-46c7-455e-969e-d8bb3c827401","title":"Chapter 38","date":"2025-11-11"},{"number":"37","chapter":"37","slug":"afe27504-833d-4644-ac16-a5cef21075e0","title":"Chapter 37","date":"2025-11-11"},{"number":"36","chapter":"36","slug":"4207cc4a-c519-467a-bb90-378df4fb937e","title":"Chapter 36","date":"2025-05-24"},{"number":"35","chapter":"35","slug":"a66f7e82-c3cc-43e5-87d0-c6dff723c89f","title":"Chapter 35","date":"2025-05-23"},{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"663017ba-d99a-43a4-a91a-459fbec978df","title":"Chapter 34","date":"2025-05-23"},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"ee46abc8-fe87-4b8f-835a-5c008bbd7922","title":"Chapter 33","date":"2025-05-04"},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"8d7a939a-1748-4cb3-bb66-f8341fb8c2fb","title":"Chapter 32","date":"2025-05-03"},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"069af8d5-30fd-43c8-b67b-54e0c8056d0f","title":"Chapter 31","date":"2025-05-03"},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"cde76825-67c1-497b-8654-095943b5449c","title":"Chapter 30","date":"2025-05-03"},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"f0d7b92f-b1fb-45e9-9a24-239e7f830f74","title":"Chapter 29","date":"2025-05-03"},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"699a212f-e27a-4e36-8f09-6bd34fed40b1","title":"Chapter 28","date":"2025-05-03"},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"41fad204-0095-